<title>USA: Cambior stake raised by Caisse de depot.</title>
<headline>Cambior stake raised by Caisse de depot.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de depot et placement du Quebec said Tuesday it has raised its stake in Cambior Inc to 7.81 percent or 4,697,678 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the investor said it most recently purchased 609,000 shares of the Montreal gold producer between June 23 and July 11 at C$15.16 to C$16.42 a share.</p>
</text>
